# What KiCad and KiCad MCP Pro leave in a project that never belongs in its repo, for every git on the mcp VM
# (servers/kicad.nix): an agent's commit takes everything else under the project.

# KiCad: open-file locks (another KiCad would think the project is open), per-user view settings, caches, backups.
~*.lck
*.kicad_prl
fp-info-cache
*-backups/
_autosave-*
\#auto_saved_files\#

# KiCad MCP Pro: its working state and reports (its own git setup ignores output/ too).
.kicad-mcp/
output/
